OL,3,GNEWSA'I denied I was pregnant until the
OL,4,Aday my daughter was born'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor 14 years, Shannon Senior had worked
OL,7,Fas a nurse. But when she became
OL,8,Fpregnant with her first child in 2023,
OL,9,Fshe said she could not accept what was
OL,10,Fhappening.
OL,12,F"I just thought this is going to ruin
OL,13,Fmy life... and I just went into
OL,14,Fcomplete shock about it, for the whole
OL,15,Fnine months, it just didn't exist.
OL,17,FThe Solihull mum said she avoided
OL,18,Fpreparing for the baby, including
OL,19,Fdecorating a nursery, and wore hospital
OL,20,Fscrubs to hide the changes to her body.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
