OL,3,GNEWSA'I denied I was pregnant until the
OL,4,Aday my daughter was born'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My body just went into self-defence
OL,7,Fmode and thought 'focus on what you do
OL,8,Fbest, which is nurse', and the scrubs
OL,9,Fthat we wear in the hospital hid the
OL,10,Fbump very well."
